        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralph Tresvant, Chad Smith\n- Roles: lead singer, drummer, musician\n- Groups: New Edition, Red Hot Chili Peppers\n- Songs: \"Stone Cold Gentleman\"\n- Albums: Ralph Tresvant\n\nFacts:\n- Chad Smith was born on October 25, 1961.\n- Ralph Tresvant was born on May 16, 1968.\n- Chad Smith is an American musician and became the drummer of the Red Hot Chili Peppers in 1988.\n- Ralph Tresvant, also known as Rizz and Rizzo, is an American contemporary R&B singer best known as the lead singer of New Edition.\n- \"Stone Cold Gentleman\" is a song performed by Ralph Tresvant.\n- \"Stone Cold Gentleman\" was issued as the second single from Ralph Tresvant's eponymous debut album.",
